 nick.maniscalco@alfalaval.com wrote:

 >      I know that the axppci33's SRM doesnt support 100baseTX=2E  Does this=20
 >      mean that 100baseTX wont work with this board then?

No.. once you have the kernel loaded, the kernel should be able to make
it work in 100baseTX mode.

To do this, you need to use ifconfig's "media" directive, like so:

	ifconfig de0 media 100tx

Hope this helps.

