Subject: EB66 support

Hi folks...

So, while waiting for something to compile (on a much slower machine),
I happened to take a look at the EB66 info I have.  It looked extremely
easy to add support for that system, so I took at crack at it.

The EB66 is basically an EB64+, but with a 21066 LCA CPU, instead of
a 21064 CPU and an APECS core logic.

I don't have the hardware (does _anyone_ have an EB66? :-), but it looked
so simple, it seemed silly to not just add the code and note it as
"experimental" (or something :-).

If you have one of these beasties, let me know...

